; One variable: where each row's top edge lands in VBoxContainer's vertical solve. Both columns
; hold four children with the same minimum heights (60, 40, 40, 90) and
; `theme_override_constants/separation = 24`, and no text, stylebox or texture, so only the solve
; moves a band. No other golden solves a container, so this alone catches a lost `separation`.

